Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:04:43.50,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}阿尔卡拉斯 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}13-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}11{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 弗里茨 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.02,EN,,0,0,0,,We have Roger Federer in the front row,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,前排坐着罗杰·费德勒，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:06.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Sir Andy Murray in the front row.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,前排还有安迪·穆雷爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:11.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure they would play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:11.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都不确定他们在那种时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,the drop shot at times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,敢不敢放小球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:14.34,EN,,0,0,0,,when you play the drop shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:14.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,而你放了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You're down match point,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你被对手拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.30,EN,,0,0,0,,you have a match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,你自己也拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:18.34,EN,,0,0,0,,How do you have the confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:18.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,你哪来的自信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:22.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to hit drop shots in those huge moments?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:22.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那么关键的时刻放小球？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, I just, I feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 我是说 我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:28.70,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel the drop shot is, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:28.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得放小球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.60,EN,,0,0,0,,part of my, of my game already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经是我打法的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:34.22,EN,,0,0,0,,And, you know, I just, I'm trying to use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是想用它
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:37.02,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, in my favor, you know, I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,让它为我所用 我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:38.30,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, the drop shot that I made,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:38.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在这场比赛里放的小球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.50,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, in the match, I think I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得都赢下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.90,EN,,0,0,0,,If not, you know, every drop shot, at least,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,就算不是每一个 至少
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:46.88,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, a really high percentage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,成功率也非常高
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:48.58,EN,,0,0,0,,So, you know, in those moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以在那些时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:49.46,EN,,0,0,0,,in those really close
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那些比分很接近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:50.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and important moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:50.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,又很关键的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:53.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I tried to use it because it was a, it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就试着用它 因为它
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:56.46,EN,,0,0,0,,was a really good weapon for me, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说是非常好的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:57.34,EN,,0,0,0,,in this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这场比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:00:59.30,EN,,0,0,0,,And obviously I have been practicing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:00:59.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我从很小的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:01.42,EN,,0,0,0,,the drop shot since I was a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:01.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,就一直在练放小球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:06.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So it's part of, it's part of my game already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这已经是我打法的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:12.07,EN,,0,0,0,,Not all stadiums
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:12.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是每座球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:15.11,EN,,0,0,0,,have a jumbotron like we have at the O2.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:15.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,都有O2这样的大屏幕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:16.33,EN,,0,0,0,,You hit some incredible shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:16.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,你打出了一些不可思议的球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:17.71,EN,,0,0,0,,you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,你一向如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.71,0:01:19.27,EN,,0,0,0,,Tonight, I saw you looking up at some
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.71,0:01:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚我看到你抬头看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:20.59,EN,,0,0,0,,of your own replays.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:20.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己的回放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:22.11,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you ever look at your own replays
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:22.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会不会看着自己的回放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.11,0:01:26.41,EN,,0,0,0,,and say, you know what, that's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.11,0:01:26.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,说 你知道吗 还不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.41,0:01:27.45,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.41,0:01:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:32.47,EN,,0,0,0,,I just, I mean, I, I love, I love tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:32.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 我真的很爱网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.47,0:01:34.77,EN,,0,0,0,,and that when, when sometimes, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.47,0:01:34.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.77,0:01:37.65,EN,,0,0,0,,not even in my match or not even my shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.77,0:01:37.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,甚至不是我的比赛 不是我的球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.65,0:01:38.49,EN,,0,0,0,,the opponent's shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.65,0:01:38.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,是对手的球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:41.99,EN,,0,0,0,,when it's a really, a really great shot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:41.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,当那是一记特别精彩的球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.99,0:01:44.95,EN,,0,0,0,,or great points, I really like to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.99,0:01:44.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者一分 我真的很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.95,0:01:45.71,EN,,0,0,0,,rewatch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.95,0:01:45.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,再看一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:48.13,EN,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:48.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,为什么不呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I think one of the, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得有一件
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:55.32,EN,,0,0,0,,one of the things that I'm going to tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要去说一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:55.90,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, every tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟每站比赛都说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:58.18,EN,,0,0,0,,is to take off all the, you know, screens
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:58.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是把所有屏幕都撤掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:02.04,EN,,0,0,0,,that I'm not trying not to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,免得我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:04.06,EN,,0,0,0,,lose the focus on the matches, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:04.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,在比赛里分心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:05.22,EN,,0,0,0,,rewatching the points, but you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,去看回放 不过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.72,EN,,0,0,0,,anyways, it's a, for me, it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,总之 对我来说这很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:11.14,EN,,0,0,0,,And it is a moment that I can, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一个能让我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:16.66,EN,,0,0,0,,relax myself and still go, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:16.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,放松一下 然后继续往前的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:21.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Team World won both matches
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:21.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,世界队今天下午
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:22.68,EN,,0,0,0,,this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,两场都赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:22.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:24.52,EN,,0,0,0,,were only down two points heading
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,只落后两分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:25.50,EN,,0,0,0,,into this match,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,进入这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.50,EN,,0,0,0,,but did you feel like it was a must-win match
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你是不是觉得这场必须赢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:29.56,EN,,0,0,0,,for yourself and team Europe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:29.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你自己和欧洲队来说？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:33.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, I mean, two great
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.56,0:02:33.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 今天输了两场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:36.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and tough losses today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:36.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,都很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:37.98,EN,,0,0,0,,And obviously I was thinking a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我当然想到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:39.70,EN,,0,0,0,,about last year that we lost, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,去年周六
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:41.76,EN,,0,0,0,,every match, you know, on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们每一场都输了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:44.26,EN,,0,0,0,,So I didn't, I, you know, coming to the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:44.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以来比赛的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:47.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I was trying not to let it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:47.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,就想别让它再发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:49.38,EN,,0,0,0,,So I was kind of nervous at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以一开始我有点紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:51.54,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to lie, but really, really happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,不骗你们 但真的非常高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.16,EN,,0,0,0,,that I took the win at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后我拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:55.50,EN,,0,0,0,,And, you know, I'm probably,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:55.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:03:01.86,EN,,0,0,0,,or I hope that I just made, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:03:01.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者说我希望 我刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:06.26,EN,,0,0,0,,my players and the doubles next to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:06.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,让队友们和打双打的两位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:07.16,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, a little bit relaxed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,稍微放松一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:11.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and not feeling the pressure at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,完全不用感到压力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:15.70,EN,,0,0,0,,And finally, you do this better
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:15.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后 这一点你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:17.34,EN,,0,0,0,,than almost any athlete I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,比我见过的几乎所有人都强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:18.34,EN,,0,0,0,,In moments of stress,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:18.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,在有压力的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:19.72,EN,,0,0,0,,in times where you're losing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:19.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,在落后的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:21.82,EN,,0,0,0,,you have a smile on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:21.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,你脸上还带着笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.32,EN,,0,0,0,,How do you keep a smile on your face
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:26.98,EN,,0,0,0,,during those tough times?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:26.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那些艰难时刻还笑得出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:30.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:30.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:35.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm too young still, though, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我还太年轻了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:43.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, what was the question? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:43.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 问题是什么来着？抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:45.83,EN,,0,0,0,,It was during times of stress,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,是说在有压力的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:47.05,EN,,0,0,0,,how do you keep a smile on your face
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:47.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么做到一直笑着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.05,0:03:48.61,EN,,0,0,0,,at all times?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.05,0:03:48.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,在任何时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.61,0:03:50.51,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, it's, I try, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.61,0:03:50.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 我努力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:52.41,EN,,0,0,0,,because every time that I smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:52.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为每次我笑的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:55.45,EN,,0,0,0,,it feels like I'm having fun and I'm relaxed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:55.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,就觉得自己玩得开心 很放松
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:56.53,EN,,0,0,0,,my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:56.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:59.27,EN,,0,0,0,,And, you know, when that time comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:59.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,而当那种时候到来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.27,0:04:03.23,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, it's when I play my best tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.27,0:04:03.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是我打出最好网球的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:04.73,EN,,0,0,0,,when I'm relaxed, when I'm happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:04.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,当我放松 当我开心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:06.77,EN,,0,0,0,,when I'm enjoying the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:06.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,当我享受当下的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:07.35,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, I think one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:07.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:09.55,EN,,0,0,0,,of the most important things to accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:09.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,最重要的事情之一是接受
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:10.69,EN,,0,0,0,,accept the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:10.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,接受当下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.69,0:04:14.21,EN,,0,0,0,,even if it is break one down, break one up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.69,0:04:14.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管落后还是领先一个破发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:16.17,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, really six hours in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:16.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的是六个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:18.49,EN,,0,0,0,,where you have to accept that moment
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:18.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,你都得接受那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:20.85,EN,,0,0,0,,and go for it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,并且一直全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:24.45,EN,,0,0,0,,So when I'm just thinking about this, there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:24.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以当我想到这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:27.45,EN,,0,0,0,,is a tennis match, there is a, it is a game
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一场网球比赛 是一场游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:31.53,EN,,0,0,0,,and I realize that it is when I'm keep enjoying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:31.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,我意识到 就是当我一直享受
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:34.27,EN,,0,0,0,,and pull off my great tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:34.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,才打得出我最好的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:35.29,EN,,0,0,0,,and my great sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:35.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有我的绝活
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:37.83,EN,,0,0,0,,So that's why I just, I'm trying to have fun
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:37.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我才会尽量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:39.39,EN,,0,0,0,,as much as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:39.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,让自己玩得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:41.25,EN,,0,0,0,,Well done today, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:41.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天打得漂亮 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:42.29,EN,,0,0,0,,You've tied things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:42.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,你把比分扳平了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:44.45,EN,,0,0,0,,Carlos Alcaraz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:44.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,卡洛斯·阿尔卡拉斯
